//@version=6
// KZ sessions + PD H/L/mid merged. Skipped: stats table, range levels, opens, timestamps, DOW labels. Untested on live chart.
// shortcut: all unmitigated session pivots extend (no "latest only" mode); sessions/PD/BSL/CISD only draw inside the History window (bars), capped by limits.
// shortcut: HTF candle building only runs over the last (max_display+2) HTF candles; CISD lookback capped at 100/300 bars.
// shortcut: next-open projection skips Saturday on markets with no Saturday bars; weekly+ scaled 5/7 on those markets; monthly uses exact NY month start.
// perf: no request.security (HTF pivots built from chart bars, ADR from tracked daily ranges); time() change-detection only for ACTIVE HTFs; session loop only in window.
indicator('MTF 13', overlay = true, max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 400)
 
